# Handoff

For the next session in this repository. **Rewritten at every session close, never appended to**:
it says what is true now, not what a session did (that is `CHANGELOG.md`). If it grows past a page,
something in it belongs elsewhere (`../article-kit/docs/PROCESS.md`, "Where each kind of text
lives").

## Where the work is

*The phase (`PROCESS.md` § N) and the module; the one or two numbers that locate it.*

## Read first

*The files the next session needs, in order, each with one line on why.*

## Open

*What is to be done next, in order, each item one to three lines with a pointer.*

## Waiting on the author

*Decisions only the author can take, each one line with a pointer to where it is argued.*
